{"id":"memorial_100903","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial100900","label":"Data · Chat Log_Early Adopter.txt"},"label":"05:37 PM","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_100902","next":"memorial_100904","speakers":{"Tooth-Missing Fan":"Tooth-Missing Fan","Early Adopter":"Early Adopter"},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_100903_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"Tooth-Missing Fan","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"Hey,"},{"id":"memorial_100903_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"Tooth-Missing Fan","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"you still alive?"},{"id":"memorial_100903_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"Early Adopter","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"Nope."},{"id":"memorial_100903_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"Early Adopter","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"There are too many people in our shelter,"},{"id":"memorial_100903_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"Early Adopter","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"so some of us were selected to be sent away."},{"id":"memorial_100903_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"Early Adopter","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"Now, all their family members are crying, screaming, and making a scene."},{"id":"memorial_100903_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"Early Adopter","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"It feels like a riot is gonna break out."},{"id":"memorial_100903_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"Tooth-Missing Fan","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"Yikes..."},{"id":"memorial_100903_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"Tooth-Missing Fan","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"I suppose you should skedaddle then."},{"id":"memorial_100903_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"Early Adopter","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_09_03_description","text":"I'd be dead for sure if I did that."}]}